{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act39side_level_act39side_06_beg","storyGroup":"act39side","storySort":12,"storyDependence":"act39side_level_act39side_05_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"EP-6","storyName":"若退路在燃烧","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"安纳斯塔西奥带人围剿了船员们的营地。看到背后冲天的火光，原本已经被胡安娜放走的棘刺不愿就这样离开，在月色下毅然转身，奔向营地。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act39side/level_act39side_06_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act39side_06","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":10,"next":12,"characters":["帕斯卡拉","极境","伊西多","胡安娜","习武教士","西尔弗","安纳斯塔西奥","蒂奇","困倦的船员","冷酷的习武教士","哈维尔","愤怒的船员","窘迫的船员"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wind","volume":"1","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_wasteland_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_450_1#11$1","duration":"0.7","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#8$1","duration":"0.7","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"（小声）难以置信，那女人竟然愿意放我们离开......本来以为修复失败后，我们都会被五花大绑交给审判庭。","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_450_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"（小声）嘘......","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":17},{"type":"charslot","id":18},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#4$1","duration":"0.7","id":20},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":21},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"我知道，无论说多少次抱歉，都挽回不了你的损失。","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"我想这就是结局了，伊西多。","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"安心吧，我不会怪你，这不是你的错。做下选择的时候，我就已经接受了结果。","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"我知道，是你为我们承受了船员们的愤怒，也是你保下了帕斯卡拉。","id":28},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"......或许你也可以和我们一起走。","id":30},{"type":"dialog","id":31},{"type":"charslot","id":32},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"可以预见，女士，留在这里你会非常危险。","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"快走吧。你们之前不是吵着要跑吗？现在有机会了，怎么还不动身？","id":36},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"......","id":38},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"我是船队的首领，我不会抛下我的船员。这是我向科鲁兹立下的誓言，这一辈子我都不会违背它。","id":40},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"胡安娜女士，有样东西......我得还给你。","id":42},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"那身衣服和剑你留着吧，就当是给你的酬劳。","id":44},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"不是那些......","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"那是？","id":48},{"type":"dialog","id":49},{"type":"charslot","id":50},{"type":"text","text":"青年将手伸进衣袋，却突然停住了。他缓缓地吐了口气。","id":51},{"type":"dialog","id":52},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cloakmovement","volume":"1","id":53},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":54},{"type":"text","text":"然后取出了兜里的物件。","id":55},{"type":"dialog","id":56},{"type":"showitem","image":"item_act39side_1","fadetime":"1","id":57},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":58},{"type":"hideitem","fadetime":"0.5","id":59},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"罗盘？不......","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"不......我不明白，如果它还安然无恙，那炼金工坊里那些残骸是......？","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"如果你没在修复罗盘，那这段时间你到底在做什么？！","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"......","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":68},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"说话啊！","id":70},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"实验里毁掉的那个罗盘......是我尝试着复制出来的。真品......我没动。","id":72},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"呼......","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":75},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"25","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"什么？！我怎么不知道......什么时候的事情？","id":77},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"我没告诉任何人......","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"我不明白，你这么做的理由是什么？！","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"罗盘上搭载的心相原质......结构远比我想象的复杂。如果我不能完美地将它复制出来，那说明我很可能仍然没能理解它的本质。","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"这种情况下贸然去操作真正的心相原质，几乎只可能失败。","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"但我不能失败。你的期望，整支船队的关注，极境和帕斯卡拉的命运......都在我身上。","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"后来，我总忍不住去想，如果注定失败，至少我该有办法把损失降到最低。","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"所以我一直在试图复制心相原质。假如事实证明我没有能力理解心相原质，你们至少还可以带着真品，去找下一位炼金术师。","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"我还省出了一部分材料，不至于让船队弹尽粮绝。","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"我、我......","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"对不起，我确实想尽了办法。","id":92},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"伊西多......你觉得这样就算是尽了全力吗？","id":94},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"我算过，失败的概率超过百分之八十七......这是我能想到的最保险的办法。","id":96},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"失败并不足以让人畏惧，纵然成功的几率只有万分之一，我也会孤注一掷，倾尽所有去赌一个机会。","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"这是赌博，不是实验。","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"哈......比起成功的概率，我们拥有第二次机会的概率才更为渺茫。","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"告诉我，我们的人生到底是赌博，还是实验？","id":103},{"type":"dialog","id":104},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.6","id":105},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":106},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":107},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"......","id":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"温蒂一会儿会来接我离开，你打算和我们一起走吗？","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"......我的旅途还没有结束。","id":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"我会继续下去。","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"你呢，帕斯卡拉？和我一起走吗？","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"我......","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"走吧，至少我能想办法带你离开这里......","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"好......伊西多，你保重。","id":123},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"保重。","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"嗯，你们也是。","id":127},{"type":"dialog","id":128},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":129},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":130},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":131},{"type":"charslot","id":132},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"showall","id":133},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":134},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":135,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":136},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":137},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#2$1","duration":"0.7","id":138},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":139},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"习武教士","text":"西尔弗阁下。","id":142},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"你愿意留下，这很好，很好......","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"习武教士","text":"您忘了？我腿一直不利索，去不了。","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"......我没忘。你是之前第二次围剿的时候受的伤吧？","id":148},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"习武教士","text":"......您就是忘了。我这腿伤是行刑那天落下的，当初是您给我处理的伤口。结果伤口最后还是感染了。","id":150},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"......","id":152},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"假如，我是说假如......我当初医术没有这么差，治好了你的腿。你现在会和我们一起去吗？","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"习武教士","text":"当然了。","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"......我知道了。","id":158},{"type":"dialog","id":159},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":160},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":161},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.6","id":162},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","focus":"r","id":163},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"......","id":166},{"type":"dialog","id":167},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":168},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"......","id":171},{"type":"dialog","id":172},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sandwnd","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"s","id":173},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"s","fadetime":"1.5","id":174},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":175},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"你和他说了什么？我们该出发了。","id":177},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"安纳斯塔西奥先生......","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"嗯？","id":181},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"很荣幸与您共事。","id":183},{"type":"dialog","id":184},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":185},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"s","fadetime":"2","id":186},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":187},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":188},{"type":"charslot","id":189},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"showall","id":190},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":191},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":192,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":193},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":194},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_footstep_stonestep","volume":"0.6","channel":"step","loop":"false","id":195},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"step","fadetime":"2","id":196},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#9$1","duration":"1","id":197},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1580_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"夫人，您去哪里了？","id":200},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"......才去把那几个小家伙送出去了。","id":202},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1580_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"您吩咐的事情我都已经准备好了。","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"这几天，你......先带着手下和宝宝在盐漠里躲一躲吧。","id":206},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1580_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"我不会留您一个人在这里。","id":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"这是命令，蒂奇。","id":210},{"type":"dialog","id":211},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_footstep_stonestep","volume":"0.6","channel":"step1","loop":"false","id":212},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"step1","fadetime":"2","id":213},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":214},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":215},{"type":"dialog","id":216},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":217},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":218},{"type":"charslot","id":219},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"showall","id":220},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":221},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":222},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_fssand","channel":"ystep","loop":"true","volume":"0.5","id":223},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":224},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"ystep","fadetime":"2","id":225},{"type":"text","text":"月色下，伊西多一个人踩在盐漠上，背后一串孤独的脚印跟随着他。","id":226},{"type":"text","text":"他不知道自己走了多久，大概有整整一夜。","id":227},{"type":"dialog","id":228},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_bg_38_g21_skystarry_R2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":229},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":230},{"type":"text","text":"他觉得自己好像让很多人失望了，但又不清楚自己到底做错了什么。","id":231},{"type":"text","text":"忽然间，他想有个朋友在身边，又猛地意识到他与极境才刚刚道别。","id":232},{"type":"text","text":"伊西多猜想，温蒂应该已经找到了极境，确认自己的安全后，他们的任务也就结束了。","id":233},{"type":"text","text":"或许此刻他们正商量着离开盐漠，继续下一个任务。而他也会继续自己的旅程，一个人。","id":234},{"type":"text","text":"没什么不好，没牵也没挂。","id":235},{"type":"dialog","id":236},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":237},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":238},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":239},{"type":"charslot","id":240},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"showall","id":241},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":242},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":243},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot"