vg_npc_1582_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"如何，问出罗盘的线索了吗？","id":357},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"习武教士","text":"执裁官大人，这都只是些喽啰，话都说不利索的那种。","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"习武教士","text":"要找到罗盘，我们还需再深入这伙强盗的据点......","id":360},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"没有我的指令不要停下来，沿途的一切焚烧干净。","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"这些用来作孽的肮脏之物，没有留存的价值。","id":363},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"习武教士","text":"是！","id":365},{"type":"dialog","id":366},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":367},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":368},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":369},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.1","fadetime":"2","channel":"bse","id":370},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.1","fadetime":"2","channel":"bgs","id":371},{"type":"charslot","id":372},{"type":"bgeffect","id":373},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"showall","id":374},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":375},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_monastery_nomal.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":376,"musicid":4},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":377},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":378},{"type":"text","text":"异常的声响将伊西多扯出他的思绪，唤停了他的脚步。","id":379},{"type":"text","text":"转过头，他看见远处有什么东西朦朦胧胧地照亮了黑夜。","id":380},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"那是......","id":382},{"type":"dialog","id":383},{"type":"charslot","id":384},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":385},{"type":"text","text":"那是冲天的火光。","id":386},{"type":"dialog","id":387},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"不......","id":389},{"type":"dialog","id":390},{"type":"charslot","id":391},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":392},{"type":"text","text":"那是船队的方向。","id":393},{"type":"dialog","id":394},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"怎么会这样？","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"我......","id":397},{"type":"dialog","id":398},{"type":"playsound","key":"$runsand","volume":"1","id":399},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":400},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":401},{"type":"image","image":"57_i05","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","x":"-50","y":"-30","fadetime":"2","id":402},{"type":"imagetween","xTo":"0","yTo":"0","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"9","block":"false","id":403},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":404},{"type":"text","text":"伊西多毫不犹豫地迈出了步子。","id":405},{"type":"text","text":"不靠理性，只凭冲动，他做出了决定。","id":406},{"type":"text","text":"沿着来时踩出的脚印，伊西多拼命地往回奔去。","id":407},{"type":"text","text":"那串脚印于是不再孤独。","id":408},{"type":"dialog","id":409},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":410},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":411},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bse","fadetime":"2","id":412},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":413},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":414},{"type":"charslot","id":415},{"type":"image","id":416},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"showall","id":417},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":418},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":419,"musicid":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":420},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":421},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_chairbump","volume":"0.7","id":422},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cardboard","volume":"1","delay":"0.2","id":423},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":424},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"别再找了，你找不到的。","id":426},{"type":"dialog","id":427},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#1$2","focus":"n","id":428},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_planeshake","volume":"0.6","id":429},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":430},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"船员们告诉我，那小子的实验搞砸了，罗盘毁在他手里。你就算找到，也没用。","id":432},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"罗盘对我有没有用，不是你能说的，强盗。","id":434},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"是是......对不起。","id":436},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"我守了那罗盘将近十年，我杀了每一个试图染指它的人......","id":438},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"就算它真的化为齑粉，我也要亲眼见证。","id":439},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":440},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"你们的首领在哪里？","id":441},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":442},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"我们有过协议，你们会放过胡安娜。","id":443},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"你和西尔弗的协议，与我无关。","id":445},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"那个女人带着罗盘逃走了，是不是？那套炼金失败的说法只是借口，是不是？","id":446},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":447},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"谎言......为了保护那个女人，为了你自己的欲望，是不是？你也该被——","id":448},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":449},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"我没骗你。罗盘早就不在胡安娜手上了，她要一只已经毁掉的罗盘毫无意义。","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"你该找的只有那个炼金小子和他的工坊。","id":451},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"在哪里？","id":453},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"那边后排的第二个帐篷，地上有暗门，炼金工坊就在那底下。","id":455},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":456},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"......谎言。","id":457},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":458},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"别逼我现在杀了你。","id":459},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":460},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"......","id":461},{"type":"dialog","id":462},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.3","fadetime":"1.5","id":463},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":464},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":465},{"type":"charslot","id":466},{"type":"image","id":467},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"showall","id":468},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1591_1#1$1","id":469},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","id":470},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":471},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":472},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":473},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":474},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":475},{"type":"dialogue","name":"习武教士","text":"老实点！别乱动！","id":476},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1591_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":477},{"type":"dialogue","name":"窘迫的船员","text":"那个......你们说的是真的吗？只要找到那枚罗盘，我们都能获得赦免？","id":478},{"type":"dialogue","name":"窘迫的船员","text":"鉴于我们投降得这么快......我们的赦免是不是也应该适当放宽些条件？","id":479},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":480},{"type":"dialogue","name":"习武教士","text":"......","id":481},{"type":"dialogue","name":"习武教士","text":"蠢货。","id":482},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1591_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":483},{"type":"dialogue","name":"窘迫的船员","text":"好吧......","id":484},{"type":"dialog","id":485},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":486},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":487},{"type":"charslot","id":488},{"type":"image","id":489}],"characters":["帕斯卡拉","极境","伊西多","胡安娜","习武教士","西尔弗","安纳斯塔西奥","蒂奇","困倦的船员","冷酷的习武教士","哈维尔","愤怒的船员","窘迫的船员"]}